ter might be napping, or there's no path to the server yet 🗺️💤)", "S73": "Not checked yet ⚪🐣", "T01": "JLU Survival Kit: Essential Campus Sites 🌟", "T02": "Search site names, domains, or what you want to do 🔍…", "T03": "Sites tagged \"Intranet Only\" won't open off-campus unless you connect to WebVPN first 💡🌉; \"VPN Required\" means the site loads outside, but core resources inside (like CNKI papers 📚) need a campus connection ✨.", "T04": "Searched high and low but found no matching sites 🙈—try another keyword?", "T05": "Campus Portal / Today's Campus Bulletin 📰", "T06": "Open Campus Portal 🌐", "T07": "After logging in, the university loves popping up a welcome/bulletin page 🎉. Instead of annoying you with auto-popups, we tuck the link right here so you can open it in your browser whenever you feel like it 👀✨!", "T08": "My College / School 🏛️", "T09": "Open College Website 🚀", "T10": "Switch College 🔄", "T11": "Type your student ID or pick your college once ✍️, and we'll remember your home department from then on (saved strictly on your own Mac 🔒✨)", "T12": "Your Student ID 🎓", "T13": "Search college name or domain 🔍…", "T14": "Expand all {…} colleges & schools 📂", "T15": "JLU is home to {…} colleges and schools in total 🏫✨", "T16": "Found {…} matching colleges 🎯! Showing the top 6 first—keep typing to narrow it down, or click below to see them all 👇✨", "T17": "{…} matches found 🎯", "T18": "Open 🚀", "T19": "Copy Username 📋", "T20": "Copy Password 🔑", "T21": "Oops 🙈, you haven't set up your username yet—head over to \"Settings\" and pop it in first ✍️✨!", "T22": "Username copied to clipboard ✅: {…} 🎉", "T23": "Hmm 🤔? No password saved on this Mac yet—save it in \"Settings\" first 💾✨!", "T24": "Password copied! 🔐 For your security, we'll automatically scrub it from your clipboard in 60 seconds ⏱️🛡️", "TD01": "Public Web 🌍", "TD02": "Intranet Only 🏫", "TD03": "Needs VPN 🌉", "TD04": "Academics & Study 📖", "TD05": "Admin & Campus Services 💼", "TD06": "Campus Webmail ✉️",